{"id":"n83315-5-8","stage":2,"title":"담 · 以后","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83315-5-8-1","ko":"오늘 만나서 정말 반가웠습니다.","zh":"今天能见到您，我真的非常高兴。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"만나서","meaning":"见面，相逢","explanation":"만나다：见面，相逢；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"만나다","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66591","senseId":"2","lemma":"만나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만나서","audio":"/audio/642da571c6fc80e0d142.mp3"}},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的。","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"반가웠습니다.","meaning":"高兴，开心，喜悦","explanation":"반갑다：高兴，开心，喜悦；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"반갑다","audio":"/audio/d5cacddd111bc906da5c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70861","senseId":"1","lemma":"반갑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반가웠습니다","audio":"/audio/dc64493eda38e972304d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"b1bced847edb7e2e","term":"만나다","zh":"见面，相逢","audio":"/audio/b1bced847edb7e2eec5e.mp3","entryId":"66591","definition":"其中一人来或去，二人因而相见。","pronunciation":["만나다"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"d5cacddd111bc906","term":"반갑다","zh":"高兴，开心，喜悦","audio":"/audio/d5cacddd111bc906da5c.mp3","entryId":"70861","definition":"因见到想见的人或实现了愿望而感到欢喜愉快。","pronunciation":["반갑따"]}],"audio":"/audio/421f1aa7e217b5d4196b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83315-5-8-2","ko":"저도요. 담에 또 봅시다.","zh":"我也很高兴。下次再见面吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저도요.","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；도：表示“也、连……也”；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저도요","audio":"/audio/44b13700afadcf153a4b.mp3"}},{"text":"담에","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"담：以后，下次；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"담","audio":"/audio/3f34a6ccae9989721bd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83315","senseId":"5","lemma":"담","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"담에","audio":"/audio/38335c732e1e5fe2a477.mp3"}},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又。","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}},{"text":"봅시다.","meaning":"看，见，见面","explanation":"보다：看，见，见面；ㅂ시다：较正式的提议句末：“一起……吧”，通常用于平辈或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"30","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봅시다","audio":"/audio/5d12c5167c7da80d3dd8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"3f34a6ccae998972","term":"담","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/3f34a6ccae9989721bd8.mp3","entryId":"83315","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["담ː"]},{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21